<Defs>

    <ThingDef ParentName="Milira_OnSkinBase_Neiyu">
        <defName>MX_Mingyuan_InfernoArmor</defName>
        <label>Rosy Flamefeather Raiment</label>
        <description>Mingyuan's raiment, woven from pale extradimensional flame and burning feathers, with gold and scarlet light flowing through its rosy plumes. Though seemingly delicate, it protects her body and wings, resists common damage, provides extreme insulation, carrying capacity, movement and dodge, halves incoming damage, and never breaks.</description>
